  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/494",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">같은 그림 맞추기</span></b>로 유명한<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">[도블]</span></b> 보드게임입니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81727588cc07e98e03e002aadf176ac5869e52f1\" data-origin-width=\"317\" data-origin-height=\"301\" style=\"width:33.95%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81727588cc07e98e03e002aadf176ac5869e52f1\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a2e23af28282b8db0cb014046aa90d5726e7323\" data-origin-width=\"834\" data-origin-height=\"407\" style=\"width:66.05%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a2e23af28282b8db0cb014046aa90d5726e7323\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>어떤 카드도 2장을 놓고 비교하면<br><b> 같이 있는 그림이 딱 1쌍만</b> 존재합니다.&#160;<br>위에 그림엔 [가위]가 동시에 있네요.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>이게.....관련된 수학적 원리가 있는데요.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>[파노평면 수학이론]</b>이라고,&#160;<br>무척........무.....척 어렵더라구요.....;;;<br>&#160;<br>도전 의식이 생기시는 선생님께서는...<br>아래 블로그를 한번..<br>제게도 가르침을 한번...<br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/limchung90/221734243072\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://blog.naver.com/limchung90/221734243072</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"'set 게임'과 '도블' 속 수학원리\" data-og-description=\"대학원에서 '조합론'을 공부하면서 게임속에서 발전한 과목이 바로 이 조합론이지 않나라는 생각...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/limchung90/221734243072\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/limchung90/221734243072\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hZ0Rr/hyN9WHGsbP/Tyc6fyxVAvmjXj4LIGsBI1/img.png?width=220&amp;height=220&amp;face=0_0_220_220,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/mKnM2/hyN9ME3zuR/NO8KSYOcMVwWw64xAZ1lv0/img.png?width=500&amp;height=273&amp;face=0_0_500_273\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/limchung90/221734243072\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/limchung90/221734243072\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hZ0Rr/hyN9WHGsbP/Tyc6fyxVAvmjXj4LIGsBI1/img.png?width=220&amp;height=220&amp;face=0_0_220_220,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/mKnM2/hyN9ME3zuR/NO8KSYOcMVwWw64xAZ1lv0/img.png?width=500&amp;height=273&amp;face=0_0_500_273)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">'set 게임'과 '도블' 속 수학원리</p><p class=\"og-desc\">대학원에서 '조합론'을 공부하면서 게임속에서 발전한 과목이 바로 이 조합론이지 않나라는 생각...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>여튼, 주워먹기가 취미인 저는<br>이걸 가져다 쓰고 싶어서<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">영혼을 갈아 이미지 편집</span></b>을 합니다. ㅠㅡㅠ<br>(이미지는 비상교과서입니다)<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/765ee578860d04ac51a3992375631ccb39e9c744\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/765ee578860d04ac51a3992375631ccb39e9c744\" data-origin-width=\"932\" data-origin-height=\"649\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e95bd1056cef3a65767aba67818b1c0be4762b1f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e95bd1056cef3a65767aba67818b1c0be4762b1f\" data-origin-width=\"1008\" data-origin-height=\"684\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>위 활동지를 가지고<br><b>조원이 함께 </b><br><b>이름을 부르는 사전 연습을 합니다.</b><br>다같이 이름을 함께 불러봅니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>그리고는, </b><br><b>세상에는 모든게 이미 존재한다</b>.....는 믿음으로<br>밤새 인터넷의 바다를 헤맨 결과<br>&#160;<br>이미지로 도블을 만들어주는<br><b>외쿡! 사이트를 발견합니다. </b><br>&#160;<br><b>야호!</b><br><a href=\"http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Make your own Spot It clone\" data-og-description=\"Provide data Submit Link to this set Show instructions on how to provide data In the text area above, enter the items you would like to be made into cards. The game only works with certain numbers of items: 3 items - 2 items per card 7 items - 3 items per \" data-og-host=\"aaronbarker.net\" data-og-source-url=\"http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d\" data-og-url=\"http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d\"><a href=\"http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(null)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Make your own Spot It clone</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Provide data Submit Link to this set Show instructions on how to provide data In the text area above, enter the items you would like to be made into cards. The game only works with certain numbers of items: 3 items - 2 items per card 7 items - 3 items per </p><p class=\"og-host\">aaronbarker.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>정말,<br>세상은 넓고 부지런한 사람은 많습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>그리고! <b>두둥! 드디어 도블카드를 완성.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb2339a175315cd3a9aa95761136eac8a009d4e0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb2339a175315cd3a9aa95761136eac8a009d4e0\" data-origin-width=\"993\" data-origin-height=\"695\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">총 카드 수는 31장</span></b>이며,<br><b><span style=\"color: #0593d3;\">A4 양면 6장......을 칼질</span></b>하시면<br><b><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">1조꺼가....완성</span></b> ㅠㅠ 됩니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">평생 쓰리라</span></b> 큰 마음을 먹고<br>코팅하여 8조를 만들었....<br>가끔....아주 가끔 이런 짓을 합니다......;;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">도블 방법 안내를 간단히 드릴께요.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">대표적인 2가지 방법으로&#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1. 카드 빨리 버리기&#160;</span></b><br>&#160; &#160;<br>중앙에 1장을 덮어 놓고,<br>각자 카드를 나누어가진 후<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(2인 각 15장씩, 3인 각10장씩)</span></b><br>&#160; &#160; 시작과 동시에 중앙 1장을 깝니다. (뒤집...)<br>&#160; &#160; 같은 그림을 빨리 부르고 빨리 버리면 승리&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eace979650546766ed7d329f03d08af2cef030cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eace979650546766ed7d329f03d08af2cef030cf\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2. 카드 많이 모으기 </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(인원수 아무렇게나 가능)</span></b><br>&#160; &#160;<br>중앙에 더미(쌓아놓음)를 놓고,<br>각자 1장씩 덮어 가진 후&#160;<br>&#160; &#160;시작과 동시에 본인 카드를 깝니다.&#160;(뒤집...)<br>&#160; &#160;같은 그림 이름 부르며 많이 먹으면 우승!<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc3aefbf5c4d679556c542f59b8bdfdc484a0c3c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc3aefbf5c4d679556c542f59b8bdfdc484a0c3c\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8288a25194e0dede4df7559a82e7739f235e3f0a?download\" data-file-name=\"도블기초연습_활동지_그림만.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1163264\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D494%26fileid%3D12%26regdt%3D20220424202829&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F8288a25194e0dede4df7559a82e7739f235e3f0a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블기초연습_활동지_그림만</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.11MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31aa86cd779c0afb0421895991fa94bf93936aea?download\" data-file-name=\"도블완성.hwp\" data-file-size=\"9899008\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D494%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20220424202829&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F31aa86cd779c0afb0421895991fa94bf93936aea')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블완성</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">9.44MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>칼질에 도가 텄다...하시며<br>감각기관 도블에 도전하신다면,<br>저의 갈려진 영혼에<br>댓글 한 줄씩 부탁드립니다. 하하하 ^^<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}